","pinyin":"zài fàn guǎn"},{"zh":"在医院","pinyin":"zài yī yuàn"},{"zh":"在学校","pinyin":"zài xué xiào"}],"answer":"在饭馆","explain":{"text_id":"Perempuan: Pelayan, tolong berikan saya menu. / Laki-laki: Baik, Anda ingin minum apa?","question_id":"Di mana si perempuan?","answer_id":"Di restoran"}},{"id":"ls-restoran-l3","type":"audio_dialog_question_mcq","skill":"listening","level":3,"lesson":"restoran","turns":[{"who":"女","zh":"一共多少钱？","pinyin":"yí gòng duō shao qián ？"},{"who":"男","zh":"一共四十五块。","pinyin":"yí gòng sì shí wǔ kuài 。"}],"question":"一共多少钱？","question_pinyin":"yí gòng duō shao qián ？","options":[{"zh":"五十四块","pinyin":"wǔ shí sì kuài"},{"zh":"四十五块","pinyin":"sì shí wǔ kuài"},{"zh":"四十块","pinyin":"sì shí kuài"}],"answer":"四十五块","explain":{"text_id":"Perempuan: Totalnya berapa? / Laki-laki: Totalnya empat puluh lima yuan.","question_id":"Totalnya berapa?","answer_id":"Empat puluh lima yuan"}}],"reading":[{"id":"ls-restoran-r1","type":"cloze_wordbank","skill":"reading","level":3,"lesson":"restoran","stem":"这个菜很（　），我还想再吃一碗。","options":[{"word":"好吃","pinyin":"hǎo chī"},{"word":"医院","pinyin":"yī yuàn"},{"word":"学校","pinyin":"xué xiào"},{"word":"朋友","pinyin":"péng you"}],"answer":"好吃","explain":{"zh":"这个菜很好吃，我还想再吃一碗。","pinyin":"zhè ge cài hěn hǎo chī ， wǒ hái xiǎng zài chī yì wǎn 。","id":"Masakan ini sangat enak, aku masih ingin makan satu mangkuk lagi."}},{"id":"ls-restoran-r2","type":"cloze_wordbank","skill":"reading","level":3,"lesson":"restoran","stem":"我想喝一（　）茶。","options":[{"word":"本","pinyin":"běn"},{"word":"件","pinyin":"jiàn"},{"word":"岁","pinyin":"suì"},{"word":"杯","pinyin":"bēi"}],"answer":"杯","explain":{"zh":"我想喝一杯茶。","pinyin":"wǒ xiǎng hē yì bēi chá 。","id":"Aku ingin minum secangkir teh."}},{"id":"ls-restoran-r3","type":"short_text_mcq","skill":"reading","level":3,"lesson":"restoran","text":"今天我和朋友去饭馆吃饭。我们看了菜单，要了鱼和米饭。鱼很好吃，也不贵，一共四十五块。","text_pinyin":"jīn tiān wǒ hé péng you qù fàn guǎn chī fàn 。 wǒ men kàn le cài dān ， yào le yú hé mǐ fàn 。 yú hěn hǎo chī 